    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perrepto</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. freq. a.
		perrepo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to creep</i> or <i>crawl through</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnes plateas perreptavi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Am. 4, 1, 3</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnes latebras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rud. 1, 4, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perreptavi usque omne oppidum ad portam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Ad. 4, 6, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
